/**
 * SALUS_PROTOCOL_METRICS_V034
 *
 * Local protocol readers plus a read-only ResMed AirSense 11 secure session reader.
 * The ResMed path only performs pairing/session RPC plus read-only Get requests;
 * it does not change pressure, mode, comfort, or therapy settings.
 */
